!THE SMILLEYS: ODESSA SMILLEY (84) · LUCIUS SMILLEY (55) · VIVIENNE SMILLEY (49) · DESMOND SMILLEY (48) · LUKE SMILLEY (28) · DELPHINE SMILLEY-ASHE (25) · ESTHER SMILLEY (22)

!THE BAKERS: CURTIS BAKER (50) · GLORIA BAKER (48) · KIARA BAKER (15)

!THE CHILDREN: EMMA SMILLEY (2) · VICTORIA SMILLEY (2) · LYRIC SOLACE BAKER (2)

!THE CIRCLE: AMOND BAKER (22) · ARIANNA CUMMINGS (22) · HARMONY DIVINE (22)

!THE SEVEN: TOBIAS "THE LEDGER" OKAFOR (24) · KEISHA "GHOST" LATTIMORE (25)

!RECURRING: INVESTIGATOR CARLA MIMS (47) · CAMILLE RHODES (38) · DEPUTY CHIEF WARREN HUGHES (46) · FORMER CHIEF HAROLD JACKSON (57) · THADDEUS CROWE (40) · BEATRIX "NANNY BEA" PENNINGTON (43) · VINCE MARETTI (36) · LORETTA DIVINE (49)

!DAY PLAYERS: WENDELL SUTTLES (General Counsel, Donohue Shipping) · DONNA KEEL · MISTY CALLOWAY (Keel agent) · PHIL (Keel agent) · SMILLEY VALET · RAVENHURST MAID · SMILLEY CORPORATE SECRETARY · NATHANIEL GREER (by phone) · FLORIST DELIVERY MAN · NATASHA'S ASSISTANT (V.O.)

